      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "sighted",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_sighted_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Crelanu%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_seer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%2C2%2C3%2C4%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I sense a presence that is not one of Aquagar’s creatures. Who are you, and what is your purpose here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("That, I think, must be the mage of which Olurf spoke. But he is not the one I sensed as we approached this place..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I feel the shadow of destiny on my soul. There is something I am fated to do here, but I know not what."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("If you are the mage Crelanu, we have come to seek your help."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I am Crelanu... but if you want my help you must begin by helping me, for I am besieged here and in no state to aid anyone else."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ahhh. A fight! Perhaps this is my fate. Come, Kalenz, let us make a rescue."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 6,
            share_vision: "all",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Looks like your mage friend is in trouble. There is a horde of drakes attacking him!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Indeed. Before he can aid us, we will have to aid him."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Fools! The book will be mine!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("There... I sense magic emanating from that stone keep east of the lake. That is where we will find the mage."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Aquagar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I die, but I will not go unavenged! Cursed will you be Kalenz! You will never find lasting peace in all your years. You will lose your dearest. And you, Crelanu, your book will bring woe on you and haunt all its future owners to their graves! This will be the price for slaying me, Aquagar, great drake wizard of Morogoth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Some scary fellow this Aquagar thinks he is! Come now, I think Crelanu owes us some drinks."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Crelanu%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("There goes our last hope!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
